o people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-10-14T02:07:10+02:00","published_at":"2022-09-14T15:37:48+02:00","backoffice_id":261722,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.38891111873282},{"id":540653,"date_start":"2022-09-10","date_end":"2022-10-15","date_next":"2022-10-14","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung"}},"others":{"list":[24,35],"translations":{"fr":["Galeries d'art","Bande dessin\u00e9e"],"nl":["Galeries","Stripverhaal"],"en":["Art Galleries","Comicstrip"],"de":["Kunstgalerien","Comics"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Marc-Antoine Mathieu, D\u00e9dales, 2","shortdescr":"Du 10 septembre au 15 octobre 2022, la galerie Huberty & Breyne de Bruxelles a le plaisir de pr\u00e9senter un solo-show de l\u2019artiste fran\u00e7ais Marc-Antoine Mathieu, plasticien, sc\u00e9nographe et auteur de bande dessin\u00e9e, D\u00e9dales, 2.","longdescr":"Du 10 septembre au 15 octobre 2022, la galerie Huberty & Breyne de Bruxelles a le plaisir de pr\u00e9senter un solo-show de l\u2019artiste fran\u00e7ais Marc-Antoine Mathieu, plasticien, sc\u00e9nographe et auteur de bande dessin\u00e9e, D\u00e9dales, 2. D\u00e9dales, 2 produira probablement sur le visiteur un effet similaire \u00e0 l\u2019irruption de la sph\u00e8re dans Flatland. Et si ce dernier accepte de jouer le jeu, s\u2019il se laisse s\u00e9duire par les ruses conceptuelles de l\u2019auteur, l\u2019exposition le marquera pour longtemps. Car l\u2019art hybride de Marc-Antoine Mathieu interroge joyeusement nos attentes, sans juger ni appuyer : il invite plut\u00f4t chacun \u00e0 d\u00e9finir ses propres contraintes et limites, comme l\u2019Oulipo invitait les rats \u00ab qui ont \u00e0 construire eux-m\u00eames le labyrinthe dont ils se proposent de sortir \u00bb.","performers":"Marc-Antoine Mathieu, plasticien, sc\u00e9nographe et auteur de bande dessin\u00e9e","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.hubertybreyne.com","email":"contact@hubertybreyne.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 893 90 30","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540653"},"nl":{"name":"Marc-Antoine Mathieu, D\u00e9dales, 2","shortdescr":"Van 10 september tot 15 oktober 2022 presenteert de galerie Huberty & Breyne in Brussel een solotentoonstelling van de Franse kunstenaar Marc-Antoine Mathieu, beeldend kunstenaar, scenograaf en auteur van stripverhalen, D\u00e9dales, 2.","longdescr":"Van 10 september tot 15 oktober 2022 presenteert de galerie Huberty & Breyne in Brussel een solotentoonstelling van de Franse kunstenaar Marc-Antoine Mathieu, beeldend kunstenaar, scenograaf en auteur van stripverhalen, D\u00e9dales, 2. D\u00e9dales, 2 zal waarschijnlijk een soortgelijk effect hebben op de bezoeker als de erruptie van de bol in Flatland. En als deze laatste het spel meespeelt, als hij zich laat verleiden door de conceptuele trucs van de auteur, zal de tentoonstelling een blijvende indruk nalaten. Want de hybride kunst van Marc-Antoine Mathieu stelt met vreugde onze verwachtingen ter discussie, zonder te oordelen of onder druk te zetten: hij nodigt iedereen uit zijn eigen beperkingen en grenzen te bepalen, zoals de Oulipo de ratten uitnodigde \"die zelf het labyrint moeten bouwen waaruit zij te voorschijn willen komen\".","performers":"Marc-Antoine Mathieu, beeldend kunstenaar, scenograaf en auteur van stripverhalen","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540653"},"en":{"name":"Marc-Antoine Mathieu, D\u00e9dales, 2","shortdescr":"From September 10 to October 15, 2022, Huberty & Breyne Gallery in Brussels presents a solo exhibition of D\u00e9dales, 2 by French artist Marc-Antoine Mathieu, visual artist, scenographer and comic book writer.","longdescr":"From September 10 to October 15, 2022, Huberty & Breyne Gallery in Brussels presents a solo exhibition of D\u00e9dales, 2 by French artist Marc-Antoine Mathieu, visual artist, scenographer and comic book writer. D\u00e9dales, 2 is likely to have a similar effect on the visitor as the eruption of the sphere in Flatland. And if he plays the game, if he lets himself be seduced by the author's conceptual tricks, the exhibition will leave a lasting impression. For Marc-Antoine Mathieu's hybrid art joyfully questions our expectations, without judging or pressuring: he invites everyone to define their own limits and boundaries, as the Oulipo invited the rats \"who must construct the labyrinth from which they want to emerge\".","performers":"Marc-Antoine Mathieu, visual artist, scenographer and comic book writer","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540653"},"de":{"name":"Marc-Antoine Mathieu, D\u00e9dales, 2","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540653"},"it":{"name":"Marc-Antoine Mathieu, D\u00e9dales, 2","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540653"},"sp":{"name":"Marc-Antoine Mathieu, D\u00e9dales, 2","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540653"},"pt":{"name":"Marc-Antoine Mathieu, D\u00e9dales, 2","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540653"},"cn":{"name":"Marc-Antoine Mathieu, D\u00e9dales, 2","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.540653"}},"place":{"id":267549,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Huberty & Breyne Gallery","address_street_name":"Place du Ch\u00e2telain","address_street_number":"33","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@hubertybreyne.com","website":"http:\/\/www.hubertybreyne.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 893 90 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Place du Ch\u00e2telain, 33","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Nouvel espace de 1 000 m2 enti\u00e8rement consacr\u00e9 au 9e Art. Apr\u00e8s avoir cr\u00e9\u00e9 une passerelle entre 9e Art et Art Contemporain, Alain Huberty et Marc Breyne accueilleront en leurs murs diff\u00e9rentes manifestations : Solo Shows, expositions\r\ncollectives, lancements d\u2019albums, performances ou encore r\u00e9sidences d\u2019artistes\u2026","description_print":"Alain Huberty et Marc Breyne inaugurent \u00e0 Bruxelles un nouvel espace de 1 000 m2\r\nenti\u00e8rement consacr\u00e9 au 9e Art. Apr\u00e8s avoir fait entrer la Bande Dessin\u00e9e au Sablon, haut lieu des marchands d\u2019art et des antiquaires, la galerie s\u2019implante aujourd\u2019hui Place du Ch\u00e2telain, l\u2019un des quartiers les plus dynamiques d\u2019Ixelles. Cette nouvelle \u00e9tape marque une \u00e9volution, celle de pouvoir proposer aux artistes un endroit \u00e0 la dimension de leur talent et d\u2019initier de nouveaux projets. Apr\u00e8s avoir cr\u00e9\u00e9 une passerelle entre 9e Art et Art Contemporain, Alain Huberty et Marc Breyne accueilleront en leurs murs diff\u00e9rentes manifestations : Solo Shows, expositions\r\ncollectives, lancements d\u2019albums, performances ou encore r\u00e9sidences d\u2019artistes\u2026","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Huberty & Breyne Gallery","address_street_name":"Kasteleinsplein","address_street_number":"33","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@hubertybreyne.com","website":"http:\/\/www.hubertybreyne.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 893 90 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Kasteleinsplein, 33","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Alain Huberty en Marc Breyne openen in het hart van de Europese hoofdstad een nieuwe tentoonstellingsruimte van 1 000m2, helemaal gewijd aan de negende kunst. Nadat ze de voorbije jaren het beeldverhaal op de Brusselse Zavel introduceerden, het kloppend hart van de Brusselse kunst- en antiekhandel, vindt de galerij van Huberty en Breyne voortaan onderdak aan het Kasteleinsplein, in een van de meest dynamische wijken van Elsene. De twee galerijhouders willen de artiesten waar ze mee werken een nog betere plaats aanbieden, die past bij de dimensie en de allures van hun werk, en die hen in staat stelt nieuwe projecten te initi\u00ebren. In Elsene denken ze die plaats gevonden te hebben. Een brug slaan tussen de strip en de hedendaagse kunst blijft een belangrijke betrachting, en in Elsene zullen onder meer solo-exposities, groepstentoonstellingen, veilingen, albumlanceringen en optredens plaatsvinden. Kunstenaars kunnen er ook in residentie gaan.","description_print":"Alain Huberty en Marc Breyne openen in het hart van de Europese hoofdstad een nieuwe tentoonstellingsruimte van 1 000m2, helemaal gewijd aan de negende kunst. Nadat ze de voorbije jaren het beeldverhaal op de Brusselse Zavel introduceerden, het kloppend hart van de Brusselse kunst- en antiekhandel, vindt de galerij van Huberty en Breyne voortaan onderdak aan het Kasteleinsplein, in een van de meest dynamische wijken van Elsene. De twee galerijhouders willen de artiesten waar ze mee werken een nog betere plaats aanbieden, die past bij de dimensie en de allures van hun werk, en die hen in staat stelt nieuwe projecten te initi\u00ebren. In Elsene denken ze die plaats gevonden te hebben. Een brug slaan tussen de strip en de hedendaagse kunst blijft een belangrijke betrachting, en in Elsene zullen onder meer solo-exposities, groepstentoonstellingen, veilingen, albumlanceringen en optredens plaatsvinden. Kunstenaars kunnen er ook in residentie gaan.","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Huberty & Breyne Gallery","address_street_name":"Place du Ch\u00e2telain","address_street_number":"33","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@hubertybreyne.com","website":"http:\/\/www.hubertybreyne.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 893 90 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Place du Ch\u00e2telain, 33","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Alain Huberty and Marc Breyne are opening a new 1000 square meters exhibition space in Brussels entirely dedicated to the 9th art. After having brought Comic Strip to the Sablon, mecca to the art dealers and collectors, the gallery becomes now established in Ch\u00e2telain square, one of the most dynamic areas of Ixelles.\r\nThis new stage is part of an evolution, wich will make possible for the artists to exhibit into a space that will fullfil their talent and initiate new projects. Alain Huberty and Marc Breyne aim at bridging the gap between 9th Art and Contemporary Art, therefore they will welcome different events : Solo Shows, collective exhibitions, album launches,\r\nperformances, artists residences\u2026","description_print":"Alain Huberty and Marc Breyne are opening a new 1000 square meters exhibition space in Brussels entirely dedicated to the 9th art. After having brought Comic Strip to the Sablon, mecca to the art dealers and collectors, the gallery becomes now established in Ch\u00e2telain square, one of the most dynamic areas of Ixelles.\r\nThis new stage is part of an evolution, wich will make possible for the artists to exhibit into a space that will fullfil their talent and initiate new projects. Alain Huberty and Marc Breyne aim at bridging the gap between 9th Art and Contemporary Art, therefore they will welcome different events : Solo Shows, collective exhibitions, album launches,\r\nperformances, artists residences\u2026","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Huberty & Breyne Gallery","address_street_name":"Place du Ch\u00e2telain","address_street_number":"33","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@hubertybreyne.com","website":"http:\/\/www.hubertybreyne.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 893 90 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Place du Ch\u00e2telain, 33","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Huberty & Breyne Gallery","address_street_name":"Place du Ch\u00e2telain","address_street_number":"33","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@hubertybreyne.com","website":"http:\/\/www.hubertybreyne.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 893 90 30","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Place du Ch\u00e2telain, 33","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Huberty & Breyne Gallery","address_street_name":"