er Belgium is je ideale partner met een aanbod van evenementen op maat in heel Belgi\u00eb. \r\n\r\nSterke punten:\r\n\r\nUitstekende professionele service van A tot Z\r\nPersoonlijke aanpak\r\nGespecialiseerd in Brussel, maar gecertificeerde concepten in heel Belgi\u00eb\r\n\r\nProef hun culinaire wandelingen en ontdek een stad door lekker te eten en te drinken! ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Discover Belgium","address_street_name":"Rue Dieudonn\u00e9 Lef\u00e8vre","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@discover-belgium.be","website":"http:\/\/www.discover-belgium.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 227 46 75","phone_booking":"+32 477 45 52 97","address_zip":"1020","address_city":"Laeken","address_line1":"Rue Dieudonn\u00e9 Lef\u00e8vre, 4","address_line2":"1020 Laeken","description_web":"Are you looking for a fun event that brings people closer together by enjoying, discovering & tasting ? \r\n\r\nTheir advantages:\r\n\r\nExcellent professional service from A to Z\t\r\nPersonal approach\t\r\nSpecialized in Brussels but certified concepts in whole Belgium\r\n\r\nDiscover Belgium is your ideal partner by offering tailor-made events with experimented guides all around Belgium. \r\n\r\nTry their Food Tours and discover a new city and taste delicious local food!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Discover Belgium","address_street_name":"Rue Dieudonn\u00e9 Lef\u00e8vre","address_street_number":"4","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@discover-belgium.be","website":"http:\/\/www.discover-belgium.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 227 46 75","phone_booking":"+32 477 45 52 97","address_zip":"1020","address_city":"Laeken","address_line1":"Rue Dieudonn\u00e9 Lef\u00e8vre, 4","address_line2":"1020 Laeken","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Discover Belgi