fique, Odezenne viendra pr\u00e9senter sur sc\u00e8ne son cinqui\u00e8me album studio, \u201c1200 m\u00e8tres en tout\u201d, teint\u00e9 de la po\u00e9sie du quotidien, qui leur est ch\u00e8re.\r\nSecond passage au Festival des Libert\u00e9s ... rien de plus logique!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.festivaldeslibertes.be","email":"info@festivaldeslibertes.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 289 69 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 53 03","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542147"},"nl":{"name":"Odezenne","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Alix, Jacques en Mattia vormen het prote\u00efsche Franse trio Odezenne, die zowel zenders als sensoren van emoties zijn. De groep verspreid in zijn muziek een bijna ontembare magma van vintage synthesizers en de energie van krachtige teksten. Het veelbelovende Odezenne komt op het podium om hun vijfde studio-album, \u201c1200 m\u00e8tres en tout\", te verdedigen, getint met de po\u00ebzie van het alledaagse leven, dat hen na aan het hart ligt.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542147"},"en":{"name":"Odezenne","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Alix, Jacques and Mattia form the protean French trio Odezenne, who are both transmitters and sensors of emotions. The group spreads an almost indomitable magma of vintage synthesizers and the energy of powerful lyrics in their music. Prolific, Odezenne will come on stage to defend their fifth studio album, \"1200 m\u00e8tres en tout\", tinged with the poetry of everyday life, so dear to them.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542147"},"de":{"name":"Odezenne","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":nu