s\u2019approprier les objets de la sc\u00e9nographie.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543897"},"nl":{"name":"Cocon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Een show voor kinderen van 6 maanden tot 2,5 jaar.\r\nNet als de magnarellen, de vrouwen die de zijderupsen verzorgen en begeleiden tijdens hun metamorfose, verzorgen een vrouw en haar muzikale metgezel de eieren, rupsen en cocon en zorgen zij ervoor dat de vlinders uitkomen.\r\nAan het einde van de voorstelling worden kinderen en hun ouders uitgenodigd op het wollen tapijt om zich de voorwerpen van de scenografie toe te eigenen.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/cultuur.elsene.be\/nl\/","email":"compagnie.zvouki@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 487 43 54 03","phone_booking":"+32 487 43 54 03","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543897"},"en":{"name":"Cocon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"A show for children from 6 months to 2 and a half years old.\r\nLike the magnarelles, the women who look after the silkworms and accompany them throughout their metamorphosis, a woman and her musician companion take care of the eggs, caterpillars and cocoon and see to it that the butterflies hatch.\r\nAt the end of the show, children and their parents are invited to the woolen carpet to appropriate the objects of the scenography","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543897"},"de":{"name":"Cocon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543897"},"it":{"name":"Cocon","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"perf