,"place":{"id":329,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La gestion artistique du lieu, longtemps assur\u00e9e par le Botanique, a \u00e9t\u00e9 attribu\u00e9 \u00e0 Brussels Expo. La programmation musicale restera centrale, n\u00e9anmoins, danse, th\u00e9\u00e2tre ou op\u00e9ra investissent quelquefois son ar\u00e8ne. Sans oublier le cirque, art auquel \u00e9tait initialement d\u00e9di\u00e9e cette salle, comme le rappelle encore son nom.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Koninklijk Circus","address_street_name":"Onderrichtsstraat","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@koninklijkcircusbrussel.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Onderrichtsstraat, 81","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het gebouw dateert van 1878, toen het dienstdeed als het enige permanente Brusselse circus. Dit voormalige circus is wellicht een van de gezelligste zalen van Brussel. Het artistieke beheer, lang in handen van de Botanique, is overgegaan naar Brussels Expo. De programmatie van concerten primeert, maar er vinden ook dansspektakels en shows plaats die gesmaakt worden door jong en oud. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"This former circus built in 1878 is probably one of the nicest venues in Brussels. The artistic management of the site, long granted by the Botanique, is in the hands of Brussels Expo now. Music programming remains the central activity, however, dance, theater or opera sometimes invest its arena too. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Cirque Royal","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Enseignement","address_street_number":"81","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@cirqueroyalbruxelles.be","website":"http:\/\/www.cirque-royal-bruxelles.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de l'Enseignement, 81","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"so