ziende personen","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for blind and partially-sighted persons","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-10-11T05:05:48+02:00","published_at":"2022-10-03T12:49:11+02:00","backoffice_id":262943,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"misc","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":1.2599210498949},{"id":539555,"date_start":"2022-10-16","date_end":"2022-10-16","date_next":"2022-10-16","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"fr":"Concert","nl":"Concert","en":"Concert","de":"Konzert"}},"others":{"list":[2],"translations":{"fr":["Classique"],"nl":["Klassiek"],"en":["Classical"],"de":["Klassisch"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"3rd Brussels Cello Festival : Closing Concert | Cellobration!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Le concert de cl\u00f4ture est le programme familial pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9 du Festival de violoncelle de Bruxelles - le spectacle est compos\u00e9 de tous les artistes du festival et de jeunes talents qui se r\u00e9unissent pour interpr\u00e9ter certains de nos r\u00e9pertoires les plus appr\u00e9ci\u00e9s... en tant qu'orchestre de violoncelles du BCF ! Amenez tous vos amis et votre famille de tous \u00e2ges - ce programme est s\u00fbr de plaire aux m\u00e9lomanes les plus exigeants !\r\n\r\nPROGRAMME\r\n\r\nC. Saint-Saens | Bacchanale de Samson et Dalila\r\nVashti Hunter, Ella Van Poucke, Chiara Samatanga, Natania Hoffman, violoncelles\r\n\r\nA. Piazzolla | La Muerte del Angel\r\nJing Zhao, Sul Yoon, Vashti Hunter, Jens Peter Maintz, violoncelles\r\n\r\nDvorak, Ayres, Francini | Laur\u00e9ats du Concours international de violoncelle Buchet 2022\r\nLes premiers laur\u00e9ats seront annonc\u00e9s le 11 octobre\r\n\r\nM. Lauridsen | O Magnum Mysterium \r\nElla Van Poucke, Justus Grimm, Jens Peter Maintz, Hayoung Choi, Natania Hoffman, Vashti Hunter, Jing Zhao, Han Bin Yoon, violoncelles\r\n\r\nA. Piazzolla | Fuga y Misterio \r\nElla Van Poucke, Justus Grimm, Jens Peter Maintz, Hayoung Choi, Sul Yoon, Natania Hoffman, Olsi Leka, Vashti Hunter, Amy Norrington, Jing Zhao, Chiara Samatanga, Han Bin Yoon, violoncelles\r\n\r\n- pause - \r\n\r\nE. Elgar | Salut d'Amour \r\nAmy Norrington, violoncelle\r\nOrchestre de violoncelles de la BCF\r\n\r\nE. Elgar | Nimrod\r\nBCF Cello Orchestra\r\n\r\nC. Saint-Saens | Allegro Appassionato \r\nJustus Grimm, solo\r\nVashti Hunter, Ella Van Poucke, Jing Zhao, Luc Tooten, Amy Norrington, Chiara Samatanga, ensemble de violoncelles\r\n\r\nM. Ravel | Pavane\r\nOrchestre de violoncelles de la BCF\r\n\r\nA. Dvorak | Largo de la Symphonie du Nouveau Monde\r\nOrchestre de violoncelles BCF\r\n\r\nB. D\u00e9jardin | Aquarelle pour violoncelle\r\nOrchestre de violoncelles BCF","performers":"Justus Grimm (violoncelliste)\r\nVashti Hunter (violoncelliste)\r\n Ella Van Poucke (violoncelliste)\r\n Jing Zhao (violoncelliste)\r\n Luc Tooten (violoncelliste)\r\n Amy Norrington (violoncelliste)\r\n Chiara Samatanga (violoncelliste)\r\nJens Peter Maintz (violoncelliste)\r\n Hayoung Choi (violoncelliste)\r\n Sul Yoon (violoncelliste)\r\nNatania Hoffman (violoncelliste)\r\n Olsi Leka (violoncelliste)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.brusselscellofestival.com","email":"info@belgiumcellosociety.com","phone_contact":"+32 456 14 80 42","phone_booking":"+32 456 14 80 42","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539555"},"nl":{"name":"3rd Brussels Cello Festival : Closing Concert | Cellobration!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Het Slotconcert is een favoriet programma van het Brussels Cellofestival voor de hele familie - de voorstelling bestaat uit alle festivalartiesten en jonge talenten die samenkomen om enkele van onze meest geliefde repertoires uit te voeren... als het BCF cello-orkest! Breng al je vrienden en familie van alle leeftijden mee - dit programma zal zelfs de meest veeleisende muziekliefhebber zeker kunnen bekoren!\r\n\r\nPROGRAMMA\r\n\r\nC. Saint-Saens | Bacchanale uit Samson en Delilah\r\nVashti Hunter, Ella Van Poucke, Chiara Samatanga, Natania Hoffman, cello's\r\n\r\nA. Piazzolla | La Muerte del Angel\r\nJing Zhao, Sul Yoon, Vashti Hunter, Jens Peter Maintz, cello's\r\n\r\nDvorak, Ayres, Francini | Winnaars van het 2022 Buchet Internationaal Cello Concours\r\nTop laureaten worden op 11 oktober bekend gemaakt\r\n\r\nM. Lauridsen | O Magnum Mysterium \r\nElla Van Poucke, Justus Grimm, Jens Peter Maintz, Hayoung Choi, Natania Hoffman, Vashti Hunter, Jing Zhao, Han Bin Yoon, cello's\r\n\r\nA. Piazzolla | Fuga y Misterio \r\nElla Van Poucke, Justus Grimm, Jens Peter Maintz, Hayoung Choi, Sul Yoon, Natania Hoffman, Olsi Leka, Vashti Hunter, Amy Norrington, Jing Zhao, Chiara Samatanga, Han Bin Yoon, cello's\r\n\r\n- Pauze - \r\n\r\nE. Elgar | Salut d'Amour \r\nAmy Norrington, cello\r\nBCF Cello Orkest\r\n\r\nE. Elgar | Nimrod\r\nBCF Cello Orkest\r\n\r\nC. Saint-Saens | Allegro Appassionato \r\nJustus Grimm, solo\r\nVashti Hunter, Ella Van Poucke, Jing Zhao, Luc Tooten, Amy Norrington, Chiara Samatanga, cello ensemble\r\n\r\nM. Ravel | Pavane\r\nBCF Cello Orkest\r\n\r\nA. Dvorak | Largo uit de Nieuwe Wereld Symfonie\r\nBCF Cello Orkest\r\n\r\nB. D\u00e9jardin | Aquarela Do Violoncelo\r\nBCF Cello Orkest","performers":"Justus Grimm (cellist)\r\nVashti Hunter (cellist)\r\n Ella Van Poucke (cellist)\r\n Jing Zhao (cellist)\r\n Luc Tooten (cellist)\r\n Amy Norrington (cellist)\r\n Chiara Samatanga (cellist)\r\nJens Peter Maintz (cellist)\r\n Hayoung Choi (cellist)\r\n Sul Yoon (cellist)\r\nNatania Hoffman (cellist)\r\n Olsi Leka (cellist)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539555"},"en":{"name":"3rd Brussels Cello Festival : Closing Concert | Cellobration!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"The Closing Concert is an all-time family favorite programme of the Brussels Cello Festival - the performance is comprised of all the festival artists and young talents who come together to perform some of our most beloved repertoire\u2026 as the BCF cello orchestra! Bring all your friends and family of all ages \u2013 this programme is sure to please even the most discerning music lover!\r\n\r\nPROGRAMME\r\n\r\nC. Saint-Saens | Bacchanale form Samson and Delilah\r\nVashti Hunter, Ella Van Poucke, Chiara Samatanga, Natania Hoffman, cellos\r\n\r\nA. Piazzolla | La Muerte del Angel\r\nJing Zhao, Sul Yoon, Vashti Hunter, Jens Peter Maintz, cellos\r\n\r\nDvorak, Ayres, Francini | Winners of the 2022 Buchet International Cello Competition\r\nTop laureates to be announced on 11 Oct\r\n\r\nM. Lauridsen | O Magnum Mysterium \r\nElla Van Poucke, Justus Grimm, Jens Peter Maintz, Hayoung Choi, Natania Hoffman, Vashti Hunter, Jing Zhao, Han Bin Yoon, cellos\r\n\r\nA. Piazzolla | Fuga y Misterio \r\nElla Van Poucke, Justus Grimm, Jens Peter Maintz, Hayoung Choi, Sul Yoon, Natania Hoffman, Olsi Leka, Vashti Hunter, Amy Norrington, Jing Zhao, Chiara Samatanga, Han Bin Yoon, cellos\r\n\r\n- pause - \r\n\r\nE. Elgar | Salut d'Amour \r\nAmy Norrington, cello\r\nBCF Cello Orchestra\r\n\r\nE. Elgar | Nimrod\r\nBCF Cello Orchestra\r\n\r\nC. Saint-Saens | Allegro Appassionato \r\nJustus Grimm, solo\r\nVashti Hunter, Ella Van Poucke, Jing Zhao, Luc Tooten, Amy Norrington, Chiara Samatanga, cello ensemble\r\n\r\nM. Ravel | Pavane\r\nBCF Cello Orchestra\r\n\r\nA. Dvorak | Largo from New World Symphony\r\nBCF Cello Orchestra\r\n\r\nB. D\u00e9jardin | Aquarela Do Violoncelo\r\nBCF Cello Orchestra","performers":"Justus Grimm (cellist)\r\nVashti Hunter (cellist)\r\n Ella Van Poucke (cellist)\r\n Jing Zhao (cellist)\r\n Luc Tooten (cellist)\r\n Amy Norrington (cellist)\r\n Chiara Samatanga (cellist)\r\nJens Peter Maintz (cellist)\r\n Hayoung Choi (cellist)\r\n Sul Yoon (cellist)\r\nNatania Hoffman (cellist)\r\n Olsi Leka (cellist)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539555"},"de":{"name":"3rd Brussels Cello Festival : Closing Concert | Cellobration!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539555"},"it":{"name":"3rd Brussels Cello Festival : Closing Concert | Cellobration!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539555"},"sp":{"name":"3rd Brussels Cello Festival : Closing Concert | Cellobration!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539555"},"pt":{"name":"3rd Brussels Cello Festival : Closing Concert | Cellobration!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539555"},"cn":{"name":"3rd Brussels Cello Festival : Closing Concert | Cellobration!","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539555"}},"place":{"id":266947,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Koninklijk Conservatorium van Brussel vzw","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kcb.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 213 41 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Koninklijk Conservatorium van Brussel vzw","address_street_name":"Regentschapsstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kcb.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 213 41 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Regentschapsstraat","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het Koninklijk Conservatorium Brussel (KCB) kent een lange traditie. De Vlaamse afdeling maakt thans deel uit van de Erasmushogeschool Brussel. Oorspronkelijk een Franstalig opleidingsinstituut, werd de instelling in 1967 taalkundig gesplitst. De Nederlandstalige en Franstalige afdeling delen hetzelfde gebouw en een aantal professoren. In de praktijk is het Brusselse conservatorium een smeltkroes van culturen en talen. Voor oude (voornamelijk barok) instrumenten heeft het conservatorium een wereldreputatie opgebouwd.\r\nHet KCB programmeert regelmatig concerten waarbij de studenten podiumkansen krijgen om hen vertrouwd te maken met het concertgebeuren in al zijn facetten. Wanneer zij er klaar voor zijn kunnen ze dan uitzwermen naar podia buiten... Daarvoor wordt samengewerkt met de verschillende Brusselse muziekorganisatoren waaronder Flagey, Ars Musica, Het Paleis voor Schone Kunsten van Brussel, het Muziekinstrumentenmuseum en anderen.  \r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Koninklijk Conservatorium van Brussel vzw","address_street_name":"Regentschapsstraat","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kcb.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 213 41 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Regentschapsstraat","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Koninklijk Conservatorium van Brussel vzw","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kcb.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 213 41 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Koninklijk Conservatorium van Brussel vzw","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kcb.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 213 41 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Koninklijk Conservatorium van Brussel vzw","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kcb.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 213 41 10","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","descrip