eren  een Open Mic in Bar Pilar rond het festivalthema Order to Disorder","longdescr":"Smeer je stembanden want wij willen jou horen, zowel op het podium als in het publiek. Bib Sans Souci, SpeakEasy Spoken Word Bxl en Pilar organiseren  een Open Mic in Bar Pilar rond het festivalthema Order to Disorder. Structuren, chaos, patronen of orde? Alles kan! Kom luisteren naar een aanstekelijke mix van spoken word, muziek en slam poetry. Of nog beter: grijp zelf de microfoon en betover het publiek met jouw woorden.","performers":"SpeakEasy Brussels, Bib Sans Souci, Pilar","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl","email":"pilar@vub.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542163"},"en":{"name":"Open Mic - Order to Disorder","shortdescr":"Bib Sans Souci, SpeakEasy Spoken Word BXL and Pilar are organising an open mic-evening on Wednesday 19 September in Bar Pilar","longdescr":"Warm up your vocal chords because we want to hear your voice, both on stage and in the audience. Bib Sans Souci, SpeakEasy Spoken Word BXL and Pilar are organising an open mic-evening on Wednesday 19 September in Bar Pilar. Come and listen to a contagious mix of spoken word, music and slam. Or even better: grab the microphone yourself and enchant the audience with your words.","performers":"SpeakEasy Brussels, Bib Sans Souci, Pilar","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542163"},"de":{"name":"Open Mic - Order to Disorder","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542163"},"it":{"name":"Open Mic - Order to Disorder","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542163"},"sp":{"name":"Open Mic - Order to Disorder","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542163"},"pt":{"name":"Open Mic - Order to Disorder","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542163"},"cn":{"name":"Open Mic - Order to Disorder","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542163"}},"place":{"id":273547,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Pilar","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Le l\u00e9gendaire Kultuurkaffee, ouvert en 1981, et lieu de rencontres et d\u00e9couvertes pour plusieurs g\u00e9n\u00e9rations d'\u00e9tudiants, a \u00e9t\u00e9 d\u00e9molie au cours de 2015 pour faire place \u00e0 un nouveau lieu culturel. Depuis, Kultuurkaffee a fonctionn\u00e9 comme organisation culturelle nomade dans divers endroits de la capitale.  Apr\u00e8s 4,5 ans d'errance KultuurKaffee est maintenant de retour sur le campus de la VUB \u00e0 Etterbeek, mais sous un nouveau nom : Pilar. Pilar sera un laboratoire ouvert et artistique \u00e0 Bruxelles, un pilier de soutien pour et par les jeunes. \r\nLes nouvelles salles de Pilar comprennent une salle de concert et d'\u00e9v\u00e9nements, et des zones d'exposition, ainsi qu'un caf\u00e9 durable riche en \u00e9v\u00e9nements. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Pilar","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/nl","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"Sinds de opening in 1981 stond KultuurKaffee gekend als de ontmoetingsplek voor vele generaties studenten, een waar begrip in het Brusselse cultuurleven. In 2015 werd KultuurKaffee afgebroken en startten de bouwwerken van een nieuwe cultuurtoren. Deze zijn nu klaar. Daarmee landt KultuurKaffee na 4,5 jaar omzwervingen als nomadische kunstenorganisatie in Brussel terug op de VUB-campus in Etterbeek, maar wel onder een nieuwe naam: Pilar. Pilar is een open, artistiek laboratorium in Brussel. Een steunzuil voor en door jongeren. Een huis waarin de kruisbestuiving tussen kunst en wetenschap en ook cultureel ondernemerschap een plaats krijgt. \r\n\r\nDe focus van Pilars werking is tweeledig. Enerzijds blijft Pilar een presentatieplek waar ontluikende en vernieuwende kunstenaars, maar ook gevestigde waarden een podium krijgen. Nog meer dan vroeger komen daarbij verschillende disciplines aan bod en zoekt de werking de grenzen tussen deze disciplines op. Anderzijds werkt Pilar laagdrempelige formats uit om jongeren in alle aspecten van de werking te betrekken en toekomstdenkers en -doeners met ondernemende ambities te ondersteunen.\r\n\r\nDe nieuwe vertrekken van Pilar omvatten onder meer een concert\/eventzaal en exporuimtes en zal ook een duurzame caf\u00e9werking en evenementrijk eetcaf\u00e9 omvatten. \r\n\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Pilar","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"The legendary Kultuurkaffee opened in 1981 and was a place of encounters and discoveries for generations of students until it was demolished in 2015 to make way for a new cultural site. For four and a half years Kultuurkaffee has been operating as a nomadic cultural organization, collaborating with various venues in the capital. Now they are back on the VUB campus, but under a new name: Pilar. Pilar is an open, artistic laboratory in Brussels, a pillar of support for and by young people, a place for cross-fertilisation between art, science and entrepreneurship. Pilar's new space includes a concert and event hall, exhibition areas and a sustainable caf\u00e9 capable of hosting events.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Pilar","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Pilar","address_street_name":"Triomflaan, VUB  Ingang 6","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"pilar@vub.be","website":"https:\/\/pilar.brussels\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 629 23 25","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","