e, 366","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":"L\u2019Espace Senghor m\u00e9rite bien des lauriers pour son travail formidable qui vise \u00e0 saisir les nuances multiethniques de la commune d\u2019Etterbeek. C\u2019est tout particuli\u00e8rement en musique que se retrouve cette exploration du monde. Jazz, musique classique, op\u00e9ra, th\u00e9\u00e2tre, cin\u00e9ma, contes, activit\u00e9s pour enfants de 3 \u00e0 6 ans et expositions compl\u00e8tent le programme.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"CC Etterbeek - Espace Senghor","address_street_name":"Steenweg op Waver","address_street_number":"366","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@senghor.be","website":"http:\/\/www.senghor.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 230 31 40","phone_booking":"+32 2 230 31 40","address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Steenweg op Waver, 366","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":"Het Gemeentelijk Cultureel Centrum van Etterbeek, genoemd naar de Senegalese dichter L\u00e9opold Senghor, draagt de uitwisseling van culturen hoog in het vaandel. In de theaterzaal worden ook regelmatig concerten gegeven: een aantal klassieke concerten per seizoen, een cyclus wereldmuziek en jazz.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Etterbeek - Espace Senghor","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_street_number":"366","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@senghor.be","website":"http:\/\/www.senghor.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 230 31 40","phone_booking":"+32 2 230 31 40","address_zip":"1040","address_city":"Etterbeek","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre, 366","address_line2":"1040 Etterbeek","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Centre Culturel d'Etterbeek - Le Senghor","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Wavre","address_st