00e9tisation est ce concert r\u00e9unissant le talent de la jeune Georgia et un instrument remarquable.\r\n\r\nApr\u00e8s des ann\u00e9es de silence, ce violon \u00e0 l\u2019histoire passionnante, vibre \u00e0 nouveau sous les doigts de la petite fille.\r\n\r\n\r\nProgramme\r\n\r\nJohann Sebastian Bach (1685-1750), 3e Partita BWV 1006 (Preludio \u2013 Loure \u2013 Gavotte en Rondeau) (KBR, Mus. 658 C 7, Fonds Eug\u00e8ne Ysa\u00ffe)\r\n\r\nHenry Vieuxtemps (1820-1881), 4e Concerto opus 31 (KBR, Mus. Ms. 4351, d\u00e9p\u00f4t Fondation Roi Baudouin)\r\n\r\nHenryk Wieniawski (1835-1880), Polonaise opus 4 (KBR, Mus. 807 C, Fonds Eug\u00e8ne Ysa\u00ffe)\r\n\r\nJeno Hubay (1858-1937), Carmen fantaisie brillante","performers":"Georgia Koumentakou, violon\r\nKatsura Mizumoto, piano","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/evenement\/concert-de-midi-georgia-koumentakou","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543590"},"nl":{"name":"Middagconcert: Georgia Koumentakou","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"De 10-jarige Georgia begon viool te spelen toen ze amper 3,5 jaar oud was.\r\n\r\nDe 1\/2 viool waarop ze het concertprogramma zal vertolken, behoorde toe aan de Belgische violiste Irma S\u00e8the (1876-1958). Ze maakt voortaan deel uit van de collecties van KBR.\r\n\r\nKBR stelt haar erfgoed met plezier ter beschikking van een nieuwe generatie talenten. Zoals voor dit concert, waarin we dit opmerkelijke instrument en het talent van deze piepjonge muzikante samenbrengen. Na lange jaren van stilte komt deze viool met haar boeiende geschiedenis weer tot leven in de handen van Georgia Koumentakou.\r\n\r\n\r\nProgramma\r\n\r\nJohann Sebastian Bach (1685-1750), 3de Partita BWV 1006 (Preludio \u2013 Loure \u2013 Gavotte en Rondeau) (KBR, Mus. 658 C 7, Fonds Eug\u00e8ne Ysa\u00ffe)\r\n\r\nHenry Vieuxtemps (1820-1881), 4de Concerto opus 31 (KBR, Mus. Ms. 4351, depoot Koning Boudewijn Stichting)\r\n\r\nHenryk Wieniawski (1835-1880), Polonaise opus 4 (KBR, Mus. 807 C, Fonds Eug\u00e8ne Ysa\u00ffe)\r\n\r\nJeno Hubay (1858-1937), Carmen fantaisie brillante","performers":"Georgia Koumentakou, viool\r\nKatsura Mizumoto, piano","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/nl\/evenement\/middagconcert-georgia-koumentakou","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543590"},"en":{"name":"Concert: Georgia Koumentakou","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Georgia is ten years old and has been playing the violin since the age of three and a half. The half-violin on which she will perform the programme of this concert belonged to the Belgian violinist Irma S\u00e8the (1876-1958) and is now part of KBR\u2019s collection.\r\n\r\nKBR is happy to make its heritage available to the younger generation, and this concert, which brings together a remarkable instrument and the talent of the young Georgia, is a concrete example of this.\r\n\r\nAfter years of silence, this violin with its fascinating history is once again vibrating under the fingers of the young girl.\r\n\r\n\r\nProgramme\r\n\r\nJohann Sebastian Bach (1685-1750), 3e Partita BWV 1006 (Preludio \u2013 Loure \u2013 Gavotte en Rondeau) (KBR, Mus. 658 C 7, Fonds Eug\u00e8ne Ysa\u00ffe)\r\n\r\nHenry Vieuxtemps (1820-1881), 4e Concerto opus 31 (KBR, Mus. Ms. 4351, d\u00e9p\u00f4t Fondation Roi Baudouin)\r\n\r\nHenryk Wieniawski (1835-1880), Polonaise opus 4 (KBR, Mus. 807 C, Fonds Eug\u00e8ne Ysa\u00ffe)\r\n\r\nJeno Hubay (1858-1937), Carmen fantaisie brillante\r\n\r\n\r\nx Price\r\n\r\n\u20ac 5\r\n\r\n\r\nx Tickets\r\nBuy your tickets online to ensure to have a seat. You can also purchase tickets at the ticket counter at the information desk.","performers":"Georgia Koumentakou, viool\r\nKatsura Mizumoto, piano","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/en\/agenda\/concert-georgia-koumentakou","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543590"},"de":{"name":"Middagconcert: Georgia Koumentakou","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543590"},"it":{"name":"Middagconcert: Georgia Koumentakou","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543590"},"sp":{"name":"Middagconcert: Georgia Koumentakou","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543590"},"pt":{"name":"Middagconcert: Georgia Koumentakou","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543590"},"cn":{"name":"Middagconcert: Georgia Koumentakou","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543590"}},"place":{"id":981,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Il y a six si\u00e8cles, Bruxelles appartenait aux souverains les plus riches et les plus puissants d\u2019Europe : les ducs de Bourgogne. Fins politiques et m\u00e9c\u00e8nes cultiv\u00e9s, ils se sont constitu\u00e9 un \u00e9mouvant tr\u00e9sor : la Librairie, une collection pr\u00e9cieuse et unique de manuscrits.\r\nCes chefs-d\u2019oeuvre, rescap\u00e9s des outrages du temps et de l\u2019Histoire, KBR les prot\u00e8ge pour vous et sont dor\u00e9navant accessibles au KBR museum. Cet endroit unique vous permet de d\u00e9couvrir le pass\u00e9 culturel du Moyen \u00c2ge en Europe puis de p\u00e9n\u00e9trer dans le Saint des saints et d\u2019y admirer les splendides manuscrits enlumin\u00e9s de la Librairie des ducs.\r\nEn plus de cette d\u00e9couverte unique, le KBR museum vous propose une exp\u00e9rience immersive dans la vie culturelle du XVe si\u00e8cle, la sollicitation de tous vos sens et un voyage dans le temps de mani\u00e8re originale et interactive.\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Kunstberg","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Kunstberg, 28","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Zeshonderd jaar geleden regeerden de hertogen van Bourgondi\u00eb over Brussel. Deze rijke en machtige vorsten en gecultiveerde mecenassen stelden een schat samen die ook vandaag nog weet te boeien: de Librije, een unieke en kostbare verzameling verluchte handschriften.\r\nHeel wat van deze meesterwerken wisten de tand des tijds te doorstaan en kunt u vandaag bewonderen in het KBR museum. Verken het middeleeuwse culturele verleden van Europa en bewonder dan de prachtige verluchte handschriften uit de hertogelijke bibliotheek.\r\nHoewel handschriften het hart van het museum vormen, is het KBR museum veel meer dan kijken naar boeken. Er valt immers ook heel wat te beleven!\r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 28","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"Six centuries ago, Brussels belonged to the rich and powerful Dukes of Burgundy. Skilled politicians and cultured patrons, they established a stirring treasure, a unique and fascinating collection of manuscripts: the Library of the Dukes of Burgundy.\r\nThese masterpieces, which have survived the ravages of time and history, have been looked aft er by KBR and can now be admired at the KBR museum. Explore Europe\u2019s medieval cultural past and then admire the magnificent illuminated manuscripts from the ducal library.\r\nAlthough manuscripts form the heart of the museum, the KBR museum is much more than just looking at books. There is also a lot to experience!\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 28","