mbour parlant), de la longa, de la kora, du ngoni et du balafon.\r\n\u00c9duqu\u00e9 dans une culture orale, ce musicien hors pair conna\u00eet des centaines de rythmes diff\u00e9rents et de traditions musicales provenant de la r\u00e9gion mandingue de l'Afrique de l'Ouest, ainsi qu'un large \u00e9ventail de chansons.\r\n\r\nDepuis 2017 il m\u00e8ne son projet musical d'Afro Jazz Mandingue, le ZKE ! Zourati\u00e9 Kon\u00e9 Ensemble","performers":"Avec Hadrien Pierson \u00e0 la batterie et Edem Gayakpa \u00e0 la basse","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":"ecrisnousparmail@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543111"},"nl":{"name":"Zourati\u00e9 Kon\u00e9 ensemble - Concert intimiste","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543111"},"en":{"name":"Zourati\u00e9 Kon\u00e9 ensemble - Concert intimiste","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543111"},"de":{"name":"Zourati\u00e9 Kon\u00e9 ensemble - Concert intimiste","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543111"},"it":{"name":"Zourati\u00e9 Kon\u00e9 ensemble - Concert intimiste","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543111"},"sp":{"name":"Zourati\u00e9 Kon\u00e9 ensemble - Concert intimiste","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543111"},"pt":{"name":"Zourati\u00e9 Kon\u00e9 ensemble - Concert intimiste","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543111"},"cn":{"name":"Zourati\u00e9 Kon\u00e9 ensemble - Concert intimiste","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543111"}},"place":{"id":278453,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Atelier TIPI","address_street_name":"Rue du Viaduc","address_street_number":"133","address_street_box":null,"email":"ecrisnousparmail@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/Atelier-TIPI-112833368061337","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue du Viaduc, 133","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Le collectif Klein d'oeil a le plaisir de vous annoncer l'inauguration de l'Atelier TiPi ce dimanche 1er mai.\r\n\r\nL'Atelier TIPI est un espace de rencontre et de cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9; nous proposons du mardi au dimanche des ateliers d\u2019expression et de cr\u00e9ation en lien avec les saisons o\u00f9 les petits et les grands ainsi que leurs parents se r\u00e9unissent autour de la table.\r\nLes ateliers sont ouverts \u00e0 tous. Les plus petits pourront developper leurs capacit\u00e9s tout en partageant l'entraide et les connaissances des plus grands \u00e0 la mani\u00e8re des am\u00e9rindiens autour d'un tipi. \r\n\r\nL\u2019espace caf\u00e9 vous propose une cuisine cr\u00e9ative, locale et de saison et surtout de d\u00e9licieuses gaufres sal\u00e9es ou sucr\u00e9es pour le plaisir de vos papilles gustatives.\r\n\r\nNous organisons \u00e9galement une fois par mois expo, lecture de contes, apr\u00e8s-midi jeux de soci\u00e9t\u00e9.\r\nChaque vendredi, venez prendre l\u2019ap\u00e9ro au soleil en venant chercher votre panier de l\u00e9gumes bruxellois cultiv\u00e9s avec amour par nos partenaires de chez  Biotiful.\r\n\r\nLes id\u00e9es, ce n\u2019est pas ce qui manquent au Tipi. Nous organiserons aussi des vide-dressing, des stages pour enfants et des f\u00eates d anniversaire.\r\n\r\nNous sommes ouverts du mardi au dimanche et sommes situ\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019entr\u00e9e du parc du Viaduc,  au Rez de la maison de la solidarit\u00e9 d\u2019Ixelles.\r\n\r\nNous serons ravies de vous y retrouver le 1er mai, en cette inauguration festive et printani\u00e8re, l'occasion pour nous de vous faire visiter les lieux et vous pr\u00e9senter plus en d\u00e9tail le projet. \r\n\r\n","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Atelier TIPI","address_street_name":"Viaductstraat","address_street_number":"133","address_street_box":null,"email":"ecrisnousparmail@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/Atelier-TIPI-112833368061337","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Viaductstraat, 133","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Atelier TIPI","address_street_name":"Rue du Viaduc","address_street_number":"133","address_street_box":null,"email":"ecrisnousparmail@gmail.com","website":"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/Atelier-TIPI-112833368061337","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue du Viaduc, 133","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"n