essibilities":{"list":[252,255,256,257,258,259,263,265],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible aux personnes ayant des difficult\u00e9s de compr\u00e9hension","Accessible","Am\u00e9nagements pour les personnes aveugles et malvoyantes","Am\u00e9nagements pour personnes sourdes et malentendantes","Appareils d'amplification du son","Chien d'assistance","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Voorzieningen voor blinde en slechtziende personen","Voorzieningen voor dove en slechthorende personen","Geluidsversterkende apparatuur","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Facilities for blind and partially-sighted persons","Facilities for deaf and hearing-impaired people","Sound-amplifying equipment","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-10-13T11:05:11+02:00","published_at":"2022-10-10T14:48:24+02:00","backoffice_id":263790,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.73680629972808},{"id":543524,"date_start":"2022-10-29","date_end":"2022-11-30","date_next":"2022-10-31","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung"}},"others":{"list":[24,30],"translations":{"fr":["Galeries d'art","Peinture"],"nl":["Galeries","Schilderkunst"],"en":["Art Galleries","Painting"],"de":["Kunstgalerien","Malerei"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"\u201cLa myst\u00e9rieuse m\u00e9moire mol\u00e9culaire\u201d","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"C'est \u00e0 un \u00e9v\u00e9nement artistique sans pr\u00e9c\u00e9dent que vous convie l'artiste Piotr Osuszkiewicz. \r\n\r\nCe 29 octobre 2022, de 18 \u00e0 21 h, vous sera r\u00e9v\u00e9l\u00e9e l\u2019\u0153uvre peinte r\u00e9cente de cet artiste d'origine polonaise, n\u00e9 \u00e0 Poznan et actif en Belgique depuis 1993.  \r\n\r\nSon champ artistique couvre aussi bien la photo que le cin\u00e9ma, la peinture, l'\u00e9criture, la photographie et des installations dont la plus m\u00e9morable est celle qui anima le Palais de Justice de Bruxelles, en 2002, sous le titre Surface sonore. \r\n\r\nTout r\u00e9cemment, une autoproduction dans le cadre de l\u2019Acad\u00e9mie des dessins et de l'art visuel a Molenbeek-Saint-Jean a \u00e9t\u00e9 s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9e au Berlin International Art Film Festival 2022. Vous trouverez toutes les r\u00e9f\u00e9rences \u00e0 l'ensemble de l\u2019\u0153uvre dans le dossier ci-joint, ainsi que sur les liens Internet mentionn\u00e9s. \r\n\r\nEn r\u00e9sidence actuellement dans le c\u0153ur historique de Molenbeek-Saint-Jean, Piotr Osuszkiewicz pense et r\u00e9alise ses \u0153uvres dans l'atelier Cheval Noir, en r\u00e9f\u00e9rence au nom de la rue que surplombe ledit atelier. \r\n\r\nLes recherches de Piotr Osuszkiewicz tournent autour de la m\u00e9moire - sous tous ses aspects. Outre les \u00e9l\u00e9ments de la m\u00e9moire personnelle des lieux, des personnes, des exp\u00e9riences et des co\u00efncidences. L'artiste s'immerge dans une perspective parall\u00e8le et conceptuelle de ses peintures, qui se r\u00e9f\u00e8rent m\u00e9taphoriquement \u00e0 la recherche scientifique sur la biologie mol\u00e9culaire de la m\u00e9moire, comme il l'explique lui-m\u00eame.\r\n\r\nQuel plus symbolique lieu de la m\u00e9moire et des mol\u00e9cules qui la composent et peuvent l'atomiser que la proximit\u00e9 d'un cimeti\u00e8re\u00a0? C'est au sein de l'Atelier d'art fun\u00e9raire et marbrerie Pierre Angulaire (chauss\u00e9e de Gand, 620 \u2013 1080 Bruxelles, face au cimeti\u00e8re) que Piotr Osuszkiewicz pr\u00e9sentera ses peintures en acrylique\u00a0; elles consacrent son retour au monde de la peinture et de ses couleurs.\r\n\r\nLiens:\r\nhttps:\/\/www.cinemadailymagazine.com\/post\/_2020\r\n\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mediamatik.be\/labo\/artpo\/press.php\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mediamatik.be\/labo\/artpo\/press_14.php\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mediamatik.be\/labo\/artpo\/interactive_installation_02.php\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mediamatik.be\/labo\/artpo\/text_01.php","performers":"Piotr Osuszkiewicz","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.mediamatik.be\/labo\/artpo\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543524"},"nl":{"name":"\u201cHet mysterieuze moleculaire geheugen\u201d","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"U wordt vriendelijk uitgenodigd op het evenement van de kunstenaar Piotr OSUSZKIEWICZ. \r\n\r\nOp 29 oktober 2022 tussen 18 uur en 21 uur kunt u het schilderwerk van deze Poolse kunstenaar, geboren te Poznan, en actief in Belgi\u00eb sinds 1993, kunnen ontdekken. \r\n\r\nZijn artistiek veld is breed en dekt fotografie, cinema, literatuur, schilderkunst en installatie, waaronder het meest memorabele \u00ab\u00a0Surface Sonore\u00a0\u00bb het Brussels Justitiepaleis in 2002 animeerde. \r\n\r\nIn het kader van de Academie voor Tekenkunst en Visuele Kunsten van Sint-Jans-Molenbeek werd recentelijk nog \u00e9\u00e9n van zijn autoproducties geselecteerd voor het \u00ab\u00a0Berlin International Art Festival 2022\u00a0\u00bb.\u00a0\r\nAlle referenties naar het geheel van zijn oeuvre, alsook de nodige weblinks, zal u vinden in het bijgevoegd dossier.\r\n\r\nOp dit moment conceptualiseert en verwezenlijkt Piotr Osuszkiewicz zijn kunstwerken op residentie in het Atelier Cheval Noir, in het historisch centrum van Sint-Jan-Molenbeek en genoemd naar de straat waar het zich bevindt.  \r\n\r\nHet onderzoek van Piotr Osuszkiewicz draait om het geheugen - in al zijn aspecten. Naast de elementen van zijn persoonlijke herinnering aan plaatsen, mensen, gewaarwordingen en toevalligheden, verdiept de kunstenaar zich in het \"parallelle en conceptuele perspectief van mijn beelden is metaforisch gelinkt aan het wetenschappelijk onderzoek naar de moleculaire biologie van het geheugen\", zoals hij zelf uitlegt.\r\nWat is een meer symbolische plaats voor het geheugen en de moleculen, waaruit het is opgebouwd en die het kunnen verstuiven, dan de nabijheid van een begraafplaats? \r\n\r\nPiotr Osuszkiewicz stelt zijn acrylschilderijen voor in het atelier voor funeraire kunst en marmer van Pierre Angulaire (Gandstraat 620 - 1080 Brussel, tegenover het kerkhof); ze markeren zijn terugkeer naar de wereld van de schilderkunst en haar kleuren.\r\n\r\nLinks :\r\n\r\nhttps:\/\/www.cinemadailymagazine.com\/post\/_2020\r\n\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mediamatik.be\/labo\/artpo\/press.php\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mediamatik.be\/labo\/artpo\/press_14.php\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mediamatik.be\/labo\/artpo\/interactive_installation_02.php\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mediamatik.be\/labo\/artpo\/text_01.php","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543524"},"en":{"name":"\"The mysterious molecular memory\"","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"The artist Piotr Osuszkiewicz invites you to an unprecedented artistic event. \r\n\r\nOn 29 October 2022, from 6 to 9 p.m., the recent painted work of this Polish-born artist, who was born in Poznan and has been active in Belgium since 1993, will be revealed to you.  \r\n\r\nHis artistic field covers photography, film, painting, writing and installations, the most memorable of which is the one that brought the Palais de Justice in Brussels to life in 2002 under the title \u00ab\u00a0Surface sonore\u00a0\u00bb. \r\n\r\nMost recently, a self-production in the framework of the Academy of Drawings and Visual Art in Molenbeek-Saint-Jean was selected for the Berlin International Art Film Festival 2022. \r\nAll references to the whole work can be found in the attached file, as well as on the internet links mentioned. \r\n\r\nPiotr Osuszkiewicz is currently in residence in the historic heart of Sint-Jans-Molenbeek. He thinks and creates his works in the Cheval Noir studio, in reference to the name of the street of the studio. \r\n\r\nPiotr Osuszkiewicz's research revolves around memory - in all its aspects. In addition to the elements of personal memory of places, people, experiences and coincidences. The artist immerses himself in a parallel and conceptual perspective of his paintings, which metaphorically refer to scientific research on the molecular biology of memory, as he himself explains.\r\n\r\nWhat more symbolic place for memory and the molecules that compose it and can atomise it than the proximity of a cemetery? Piotr Osuszkiewicz will present his acrylic paintings at the Pierre Angulaire Funerary Art and Marble Workshop (Chauss\u00e9e de Gand, 620 - 1080 Brussels, opposite the cemetery), which mark his return to the world of painting and its colours. \r\n\r\n\r\nLinks :\r\n\r\nhttps:\/\/www.cinemadailymagazine.com\/post\/_2020\r\n\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mediamatik.be\/labo\/artpo\/press.php\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mediamatik.be\/labo\/artpo\/press_14.php\r\n\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mediamatik.be\/labo\/artpo\/interactive_installation_02.php\r\nhttps:\/\/www.mediamatik.be\/labo\/artpo\/text_01.php","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543524"},"de":{"name":"\u201cLa myst\u00e9rieuse m\u00e9moire mol\u00e9culaire\u201d","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543524"},"it":{"name":"\u201cLa myst\u00e9rieuse m\u00e9moire mol\u00e9culaire\u201d","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543524"},"sp":{"name":"\u201cLa myst\u00e9rieuse m\u00e9moire mol\u00e9culaire\u201d","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543524"},"pt":{"name":"\u201cLa myst\u00e9rieuse m\u00e9moire mol\u00e9culaire\u201d","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543524"},"cn":{"name":"\u201cLa myst\u00e9rieuse m\u00e9moire mol\u00e9culaire\u201d","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543524"}},"place":{"id":279464,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"l'Atelier d'Art fun\u00e9raire et marbrerie Pierre Angulaire","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":"620","address_street_box":null,"email":"megastone@skynet.be","website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":", 620","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"l'Atelier d'Art fun\u00e9raire et marbrerie Pierre Angulaire","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number"