shop - atelier cr\u00e9atif \u00e0 Choco Story Brussels"}}}],"dates":[],"recurring":[],"prices":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"targets":{"list":[11,8],"translations":{"fr":["Famille","Jeunes 15-18 ans"],"nl":["Familie","Jongeren 15-18 j."],"en":["Family","Youth 15-18  yr."]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":{"list":[266],"translations":{"fr":["Brussels Health Safety Label"],"nl":["Brussels Health Safety Label"],"en":["Brussels Health Safety Label"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-10-10T17:36:22+02:00","published_at":"2022-08-04T08:44:53+02:00","backoffice_id":259263,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"other","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.23556613421026},{"id":536045,"date_start":"2022-07-01","date_end":"2022-12-31","date_next":"2022-12-31","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":118,"translations":{"fr":"Festival","nl":"Festival","en":"Festival","de":"Festival"}},"others":{}},"languages":{"spoken":["cs","fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"#EU2022CZ","shortdescr":"Programme culturel du Centre tch\u00e8que \u00e0 Bruxelles dans le cadre de #EU2022CZ","longdescr":"La culture et la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 comme des valeurs europ\u00e9ens et tch\u00e8ques fondamentales \u2013 c\u2019est le focus de programme culturel de la Pr\u00e9sidence tch\u00e8que au Conseil de l\u2019UE, con\u00e7u par le Centre tch\u00e8que \u00e0 Bruxelles en collaboration avec ses partenaires. Le slogan de la deuxi\u00e8me moiti\u00e9 de 2022 annonce la \u00ab Continuous Creativity \u00bb et nous mettons donc l\u2019accent sur la tradition exceptionnelle de la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 tch\u00e8que, qui ne perd rien en son actualit\u00e9 aujourd\u2019hui o\u00f9 cette tradition s\u2019inscrit entre autres dans le domaine de l\u2019art contemporain, les nouvelles technologies. Les jeunes esprits cr\u00e9ateurs seront invit\u00e9s \u00e0 discuter de l\u2019art, de film, de la mode et de la musique et autres domaines, avec le focus sur l\u2019innovation et la science. Nous donnerons l\u2019espace important aux artiste ukrainiens, dont nous esp\u00e9rons faire r\u00e9sonner la voix cet automne.\r\n\r\nPlus d'informations: https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/fr\/eu2022cz?locale=fr","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/fr\/?locale=fr","email":"ccbrussels@czech.cz","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536045"},"nl":{"name":"#EU2022CZ","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Tsjechische en Europese cultuur en creativiteit zijn de kernwaarden van het programma van het Tsjechisch Centrum Brussel en zijn partners tijdens het Tsjechische voorzitterschap van de Raad van de EU. Het motto van het programma voor de tweede helft van 2022 is \"Continuous Creativity\" - een focus op de uitmuntende traditie van de Tsjechische creativiteit, die zijn relevantie behoudt in hedendaagse kunsten en nieuwe technologie\u00ebn. Jonge kunstenaars zullen worden uitgenodigd om een discussie te leiden over Tsjechische cultuur op de gebieden van beeldende kunst, film, muziek, mode en meer, met de nadruk op wetenschap en innovatie. Wij geven ook veel ruimte aan Oekra\u00efne, wij geloven dat haar stem sterk en ver zal weerklinken tijdens het Tsjechische voorzitterschap.\r\n\r\nhttps:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/nl\/eu2022cz?locale=nl","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536045"},"en":{"name":"#EU2022CZ","shortdescr":"Czech Centre Brussels' cultural programme of the #EU2022CZ","longdescr":"Czech and European culture and creativity are the core of the program from Czech Centre Brussels and partners during the Czech Presidency in the Council of the EU.\r\nThe theme of the second half of 2022 is \u201cContinuous Creativity\u201d \u2013 a focus on creativity as a European value which maintains its relevance in arts as well as in new technologies. Contemporary creators leading a dialogue with outstanding Czech cultural tradition from the fields of film, music, fashion, visual arts and more will meet their audiences and one another in Brussels. Emphasis will be on science and innovation, too. Essential space will be provided for Ukrainian voices \u2013 which, we believe, will resonate far and wide.\r\n\r\nMore information: https:\/\/brussels.czechcentres.cz\/en\/eu2022cz?locale=en","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536045"},"de":{"name":"#EU2022CZ","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536045"},"it":{"name":"#EU2022CZ","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536045"},"sp":{"name":"#EU2022CZ","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536045"},"pt":{"name":"#EU2022CZ","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.536045"},"