Leerkrachten","Familie","Jongeren 12-15 j.","Jongeren 15-18 j.","LGTBQIA","Senioren","Doof\/slechthorend","Blind\/slechtziend"],"en":["Schools","Children 0-3 yr.","Children 3-6 yr.","Children 6-9 yr.","Children 9-12 yr.","Teachers","Family","Youth 12-15  yr.","Youth 15-18  yr.","LGTBQIA","Seniors","Deaf\/hard of hearing","Blind\/visually impaired"]}},"tags":["kids"],"accessibilities":[],"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-10-14T02:05:54+02:00","published_at":"2022-09-30T12:21:05+02:00","backoffice_id":262458,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"expo","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":0.31833136784577},{"id":541583,"date_start":"2022-09-16","date_end":"2022-10-16","date_next":"2022-10-14","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":23,"translations":{"fr":"Exposition","nl":"Tentoonstellingen","en":"Exhibition","de":"Ausstellung"}},"others":{"list":[36,46],"translations":{"fr":["Mus\u00e9es et art centers","Pluridisciplinaire"],"nl":["Musea en kunstcentra","Multidisciplinair"],"en":["Museums and art centers","Multidisciplinary"],"de":["Museen & Kunstzentren","Multidisziplin\u00e4r"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Corps\/Peau(Rel)","shortdescr":"A l'occasion de l'exposition CORPS\/PEAU(Rel) (lire corporel), le corps se d\u00e9voile, la peau se montre, au travers de nombreuses \u0153uvres, installations et performances.\r\nUn voyage artistique au cours duquel les artistes nous d\u00e9montrent que chaque \u00e9l\u00e9ment du corps humain est d'une beaut\u00e9 intrins\u00e8que.","longdescr":"De tout temps, le corps humain n\u2019a cess\u00e9 d\u2019inspirer les artistes.\u00a0 La fascination pour le corps et sa repr\u00e9sentation a toujours capt\u00e9 le regard des artistes, et ce depuis des si\u00e8cles.\r\n\r\nDepuis le d\u00e9but du vingti\u00e8me si\u00e8cle, le corps, jadis repr\u00e9sent\u00e9 sous des formes id\u00e9alis\u00e9es, s'est lib\u00e9r\u00e9, s'est aussi quelquefois trouv\u00e9 malmen\u00e9 sous la main de l'artiste.\r\n\r\nPeint, photographi\u00e9, dessin\u00e9, grav\u00e9, sculpt\u00e9, le corps a pris des formes nouvelles, lib\u00e9r\u00e9es, pour nous pr\u00e9senter une autre beaut\u00e9.\r\n\r\nL'artiste, autant que son l'\u0153uvre, s'est donc affranchi des codes strictes.  Il offre au regard des formes insoup\u00e7onn\u00e9es de notre intime.  Il nous montre aussi nos fragilit\u00e9s ; celles de notre vie, mais \u00e9galement celles de notre esprit.  Sans complexe, sans g\u00eane, sans myst\u00e8re, mais avec une r\u00e9elle volont\u00e9 de nous faire nous interroger sur ce qui constitue notre moi, notre vie en somme, notre corps.\r\n\r\nLa peau, son enveloppe, est un marqueur du temps.  La peau est le plus grand organe du corps.  Elle est soign\u00e9e, par\u00e9e, malmen\u00e9e aussi.  Elle est aussi support d'expression, en t\u00e9moigne les tatouages, piercing et autres maquillages.  Elle r\u00e9v\u00e8le un certain \u00e9tat d'esprit, notre personnalit\u00e9.  On la caresse, on la parfume ...\r\n\r\nLe corps et la peau sont quotidiennement au c\u0153ur de notre langage courant et imaginaire\u00a0: Il a la peau dure \/ Il n'a que la peau sur les os \/ De la t\u00eate aux pieds \/ Regard de braise \/ Il me fait les doux yeux \/ La main tendue \/ Molosse aux pieds d'argile \/ ...\r\n\r\nLe corps est vie et identit\u00e9.  CORPS\/PEAU(REL) est donc un voyage dans notre intime.  Bienvenue\u00a0!","performers":"90 artistes pr\u00e9sentent leur vision du corps, de la peau","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.artesio.art","email":"contact@artesio.art","phone_contact":"+32 470 57 40 62","phone_booking":"+32 470 57 40 62","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541583"},"nl":{"name":"Corps\/Peau(Rel)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541583"},"en":{"name":"Corps\/Peau(Rel)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541583"},"de":{"name":"Corps\/Peau(Rel)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541583"},"it":{"name":"Corps\/Peau(Rel)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541583"},"sp":{"name":"Corps\/Peau(Rel)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541583"},"pt":{"name":"Corps\/Peau(Rel)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541583"},"cn":{"name":"Corps\/Peau(Rel)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.541583"}},"place":{"id":277060,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Centre d'arts pluriels 'AUTONOMIE","address_street_name":"Rue de l'Autonomie","address_street_num