this extraordinary gastronomic experience with food lovers from Brussels and beyond. \r\n\r\nAfter a well-deserved makeover and a successful comeback last September, it's time to discover the newest iteration of the Tram Experience.\r\n \r\nEach menu follows the rhythm of the seasons and is an opportunity for our chefs to present their reinterpretation of Belgian cuisine and delight your taste buds! Rediscover Belgian gastronomy in the unique, welcoming atmosphere of a tram as it travels Brussels. \r\n\r\nInimitable chef Lionel Rigolet* is once again doing us the great honour of being the patron of the Tram Experience! His rigour and expertise, as chef of the prestigious Comme chez Soi, guarantee you delicious, perfectly executed menus. The dishes are prepared on board by catering chef Thibault Granville from Taste Great.\r\n\r\nAll aboard!","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Tram experience","address_street_name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"tramexperience@visit.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/fr\/visiteurs\/boire-et-manger\/tram-experience","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Tram experience","address_street_name":"Place Poelaert","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"tramexperience@visit.brussels","website":"https:\/\/www.visit.brussels\/fr\/visiteurs\/boire-et-manger\/tram-experience","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Poelaert","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Tram experience","addr