CASCO Phil with Festival Soloists","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Van Belgische sterren zoals David Cohen tot 2022 QEIMC 1e prijs laureaten zoals Hayoung Choi, onze Gala avond laat het CASCO Phil samen met een aantal van de meest gerenommeerde cellisten van de wereld horen: Y.C.Cho, H.Choi, D.Cohen, A.Gastinel, F.Helmerson, G.Hoffman, J.Lee, C.Samatanga, H.B.Yoon. Mis deze kans niet om zoveel top cellosolisten op \u00e9\u00e9n avond te horen! \r\n\r\nPROGRAMMA\r\n\r\nF. Couperin | Pi\u00e8ces en Concert \r\nYoung-Chang Cho, cello\r\n\r\nM. Bruch | Kol Nidrei\r\nGary Hoffman, cello\r\n\r\nC. Saint-Saens | La Muse et le Po\u00e8te\r\nHayoung Choi, cello \/ Jehye Lee, viool\r\n\r\n- pauze -\r\n\r\nD. Popper | Requiem voor 3 cello's\r\nFrans Helmerson, Chiara Samatanga, Han Bin Yoon, cello's\r\n\r\nE. Ysaye | Meditatie, Op 16\r\nAnne Gastinel, cello\r\n\r\nC. Saint-Saens | Celloconcert nr. 1 in A minor, Op. 33\r\nDavid Cohen, cello","performers":"Young-Chang Cho (cellist)\r\nGary Hoffman (cellist)\r\nHayoung Choi (cellist)\r\nJehye Lee (violist)\r\nFrans Helmerson (cellist)\r\nChiara Samatanga (celliste)\r\n Han Bin Yoon (cellist)\r\nAnne Gastinel (celliste)\r\nDavid Cohen (cellist)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539552"},"en":{"name":"Gala Concert | CASCO Phil with Festival Soloists","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"From Belgian stars such as David Cohen to 2022 QEIMC 1st prize laureates such as Hayoung Choi, our Gala evening features the CASCO Phil alongside some of the most renowned cellists of the world: Y.C.Cho, H.Choi, D.Cohen, A.Gastinel, F.Helmerson, G.Hoffman, J.Lee, C.Samatanga, H.B.Yoon. Don't miss this opportunity to hear so many top cello soloists in one evening! \r\n\r\nPROGRAMME\r\n\r\nF. Couperin | Pi\u00e8ces en Concert \r\nYoung-Chang Cho, cello\r\n\r\nM. Bruch | Kol Nidrei\r\nGary Hoffman, cello\r\n\r\nC. Saint-Saens | 