Ballon\" et \"Mus\u00e9e du R\u00e9verb\u00e8re\" et une oeuvre \u00e0 Jette : \"Pas \u00e0 pas\". Cette visite \u00e0 pied de 3 heures vous permettra de comprendre ce que l'art participatif peut apporter pour contribuer \u00e0 l\u2019am\u00e9lioration du vivre ensemble et la qualit\u00e9 de vie pour tous.\nCes visites sont offertes par la SLRB - BGHM. Bruxelles\n\n10h : sortie m\u00e9tro Roi Baudouin\n14h(NL) : sortie m\u00e9tro Roi Baudouin\n14h30 : rue Emile Delva","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","email":"info@arkadia.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542013"},"nl":{"name":"Parcours 101% \u00e0 Laeken et \u00e0 Jette (gratuit)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/nl","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542013"},"en":{"name":"Parcours 101% \u00e0 Laeken et \u00e0 Jette (gratuit)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/en","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542013"},"de":{"name":"Parcours 101% \u00e0 Laeken et \u00e0 Jette (gratuit)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542013"},"it":{"name":"Parcours 101% \u00e0 Laeken et \u00e0 Jette (gratuit)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542013"},"sp":{"name":"Parcours 101% \u00e0 Laeken et \u00e0 Jette (gratuit)","s