urant la saison pr\u00e9c\u00e9dente, nous re-invitons le bassiste chinois Yusheng et pour l\u2019occasion deux partenaires David Yih-Shiou Sung au piano et Gionata Giardina \u00e0 la batterie. Et  le g\u00e9nial quatuor portugais Quiron","longdescr":null,"performers":"Yusheng Jiang (basse)\r\nDavid Yih-Shiou (piano)\r\nGionata Gardina (batterie)\r\nQuiron (quatuor \u00e0 corde)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.tricoterie.be\/fr\/agenda\/l-agenda-culturel\/concert-escapades-joy?id_evenement=4956","email":"crit.escapades@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":"+32 2 537 96 69","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542599"},"nl":{"name":"Concerts Escapades: JOY \u2795","shortdescr":"Joy+ concert met een jazzy noot en ge\u00ebngageerde klassieke muziek.\r\n\r\nOmdat een winnend team niet veranderd mag worden, nodigen we na hun geweldige prestaties tijdens het vorige seizoen de Chinese bassist Yusheng opnieuw uit en voor de gelegenheid twee partners David Yih-Shiou Sung op piano en Gionata Giardina op drums. En het uitstekende Portugese kwartet Quiron.","longdescr":null,"performers":"Yusheng Jiang (bass)\r\nDavid Yih-Shiou (piano)\r\nGionata Gardina (drums)\r\nQuiron (strijk quartet)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542599"},"en":{"name":"Concerts Escapades: JOY \u2795","shortdescr":"Joy+ concert with a jazzy note and engaged classical music.\r\n\r\nBecause you don't change a winning team, after their great performance during the previous season, we re-invite the Chinese bassist Yusheng and for the occasion two partners David Yih-Shiou Sung on piano and Gionata Giardina on drums. And the tremendous Portuguese quartet Quiron.","longdescr":null,"performers":"Yusheng Jiang (bass)\r\nDavid Yih-Shiou (piano)\r\nGionata Gardina (drums)\r\nQuiron (string quartet)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542599"},"de":{"name":"Concerts Escapades: JOY \u2795","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542599"},"it":{"name":"Concerts Escapades: JOY \u2795","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542599"},"sp":{"name":"Concerts Escapades: JOY \u2795","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542599"},"pt":{"name":"Concerts Escapades: JOY \u2795","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542599"},"cn":{"name":"Concerts Escapades: JOY \u2795","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542599"}},"place":{"id":252101,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"joelle@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie se d\u00e9finit comme un lieu pluridisciplinaire avec 4 axes d'activit\u00e9s: l'\u00e9v\u00e9nementiel, le culturel, la formation et les initiatives \u00abcitoyennes \u00bb. Les activit\u00e9s sont de deux types. D'une part, les productions propres, qui constituent la saison, avec la programmation d'artistes associ\u00e9s, un march\u00e9 bio, des soir\u00e9es th\u00e9matiques ou encore des animations de quartier. D'autre part, le lieu est un outil mis \u00e0 disposition d'organisations externes et d'entreprises. Une foule de f\u00eates tr\u00e8s int\u00e9ressantes y ont lieu ! ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Contactenfabriek","address_street_name":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"joelle@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat, 158","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"La Tricoterie is een project met een welomlijnde filosofie, die blijkt uit de zelfgekozen naam (van tricoter, breien) waarmee verwijst wordt naar het smeden van banden om de strijd tegen de ontrafeling van het sociale weefsel aan te gaan. Opgezet als een \u00abContacten Fabriek\u00bb en een ontmoetingsplaats waar verschillende disciplines en publieken elkaar ontmoeten. Naast een culturele programmering (concerten, voorstellingen, expos\u2026) en socioculturele activiteiten die sociale cohesie beogen (debatten, conferenties, intergenerationele ateliers, caf\u00e9-filo\u2026) staan de ruimtes ook open voor verhuur aan externe organisaties en bedrijven. Tal van superleuke feestjes vinden er plaats, alsook een wekelijkse biomarkt, een repaircaf\u00e9 en een alternatieve geschenkenmarkt om maar enkele van de activiteiten te noemen die de duurzame levensvisie van de plek weerspiegelen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Link factory","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"joelle@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie is above all a civil, cultural, sustainable and innovative project. Their cultural programme featuring performances, shows, exhibitions and so on goes hand in hand with a \u201ccivil\u201d programme of debates, conferences, inter-generational workshops, philosophical caf\u00e9 etc ... The place can be rented for events and there are plenty of really great parties! ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"joelle@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"joelle@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virt