ternational de violoncelle Buchet 2022. Tous ces jeunes artistes sont d\u00e9j\u00e0 des \u00e9toiles montantes du monde du violoncelle - venez les \u00e9couter au d\u00e9but de leur brillante carri\u00e8re !\r\nProgramme \u00e0 d\u00e9terminer apr\u00e8s les \u00e9preuves en direct !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.brusselscellofestival.com","email":"info@belgiumcellosociety.com","phone_contact":"+32 456 14 80 42","phone_booking":"+32 456 14 80 42","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539554"},"nl":{"name":"Winner\u2019s Recital | 2022 Buchet International Cello Competition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Vernoemd naar de familie Buchet uit Belgi\u00eb, de stichtende mecenassen van de Belgische Cello Vereniging, trok de cellowedstrijd dit jaar 105 kandidaten van over de hele wereld. Slechts 18 kandidaten werden uitgenodigd om deel te nemen aan de live rondes, en het is ons een genoegen om u de top drie winnaars van de 2022 Buchet International Cello Competition voor te stellen. Al deze jonge artiesten zijn nu al rijzende sterren in de cellowereld - kom hen beluisteren aan het begin van hun schitterende carri\u00e8re!\r\nProgramma TBA na de live rondes!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539554"},"en":{"name":"Winner\u2019s Recital | 2022 Buchet International Cello Competition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Named after the Buchet family of Belgium, founding patrons of the Belgium Cello Society, this year\u2019s cello competition attracted 105 applicants from around the world. Only 18 candidates were invited to compete in the live rounds, and it is our pleasure to present to you the top three winners of the 2022 Buchet International Cello Competition. All these young artists are already rising stars of the cello world \u2013 come hear them at the start of their brilliant careers!\r\nProgramme TBA after the live rounds!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539554"},"de":{"name":"Winner\u2019s Recital | 2022 Buchet International Cello Competition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539554"},"it":{"name":"Winner\u2019s Recital | 2022 Buchet International Cello Competition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539554"},"sp":{"name":"Winner\u2019s Recital | 2022 Buchet International Cello Competition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539554"},"pt":{"name":"Winner\u2019s Recital | 2022 Buchet International Cello Competition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539554"},"cn":{"name":"Winner\u2019s Recital | 2022 Buchet International Cello Competition","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.539554"}},"place":{"id":266947,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Koninklijk Conservatorium van Brussel vzw","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":null,"address_