zz"],"nl":["Jazz"],"en":["Jazz"],"de":["Jazz"]}},"tags":[],"accessibilities":{"list":[252,255,259,263,265],"translations":{"fr":["Accessible aux personnes ayant des difficult\u00e9s de compr\u00e9hension","Accessible","Chien d'assistance","Accessible aux pi\u00e9tons appareill\u00e9s","WC adapt\u00e9"],"nl":["Toegankelijk voor mensen met een verstandelijke beperking","Toegankelijk","Assistentiehonden","Toegankelijk voor voetgangers met hulpmiddelen","Aangepast toilet"],"en":["Accessible to people with intellectual disabilities","Accessible","Assistance dogs","Accessible to pedestrians with mobility aids","Adapted toilet"]}},"facebook_link":null,"publication_state":"public","last_updated_at":"2022-10-11T04:06:39+02:00","published_at":"2022-06-22T12:14:33+02:00","backoffice_id":256664,"import_origin":null,"sub_type":"concert","show_in_agenda":true,"ranking":2},{"id":542156,"date_start":"2022-10-19","date_end":"2022-10-19","date_next":"2022-10-19","accept_article27":true,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"categories":{"main":{"id":49,"translations":{"fr":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre","nl":"Theater","en":"Theatre","de":"Theater"}},"others":{"list":[50],"translations":{"fr":["Th\u00e9\u00e2tre"],"nl":["Theater"],"en":["Theatre"],"de":["Theater"]}}},"languages":{"spoken":["fr"],"subtitles":[]},"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Nous sommes partout","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Lecture collective \u00e0 haute voix, Nous sommes partout donne \u00e0 entendre des voix antifascistes, f\u00e9ministes, anticapitalistes, antiracistes, antisp\u00e9cistes, de hackeurs et hackeuses, des voix en lutte pour les droits des migrants et migrantes, contre toutes les formes d\u2019oppression de nos soci\u00e9t\u00e9s, pour les droits LGBTQIA+, contre les \u00e9cocides, pour les droits des travailleurs et travailleuses du sexe, contre les violences polici\u00e8res, pour les droits des sans-papiers, pour l\u2019autod\u00e9termination et l\u2019\u00e9mancipation de tous les travailleurs et toutes les travailleuses, contre la pr\u00e9carisation, contre le syst\u00e8me carc\u00e9ral et pour les ZAD. Archive des luttes actuelles, les t\u00e9moignages collect\u00e9s en Suisse Romande sous forme de textes r\u00e9dig\u00e9s ou retranscrits, sont donn\u00e9s \u00e0 lire par tous et toutes car \u201cNous sommes partout\u201d.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.festivaldeslibertes.be","email":"bruxelles.laique@laicite.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 53 03","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542156"},"nl":{"name":"Nous sommes partout","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Nous sommes partout is een collectieve openbare voorlezing die een stem geeft aan antifascisten, feministen, antikapitalisten, antiracisten, antispeci\u00ebsisten, aan hackers en strijders voor migrantenrechten. Ze nemen het op tegen alle vormen van onderdrukking in onze samenleving, tegen de losbandigheid, politiegeweld, bestaansonzekerheid, ecocide en het gevangenissysteem. Daarnaast breken ze een lans voor LGBTQIA+ rechten , de rechten van sekswerkers, de rechten van migranten zonder papieren, de zelfbeschikking en emancipatie van alle arbeiders, en voor de bedreigde leef- en woonomgevingen. \r\n\r\nDe verzamelde getuigenissen zijn een archief van de huidige strijd, in de vorm van geschreven of getranscribeerde teksten. Ze zijn er om door iedereen gelezen te worden, want \u201dwij zijn overal\u201d.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","email":"info@festivaldeslibertes.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 289 69 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542156"},"en":{"name":"Nous sommes partout","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Collective public reading aloud, Nous sommes partout gives voice to anti-fascist, feminist, anti-capitalist, anti-racist, anti-speciesist, hacker voices, voices fighting for the rights of migrants, against all forms of oppression of our societies, for LGBTQIA+ rights, against ecocides, for the rights of sex workers, against police violence, for the rights of undocumented migrants, for the self-determination and emancipation of all workers, against precariousness, against the prison system and in favour of the zones \u00e0 defendre (ZAD). \r\n\r\nAn archive of current struggles, the testimonies collected in the form of written or transcribed texts are given to be read by all because \u201dWe are everywhere\u201d.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542156"},"de":{"name":"Nous sommes partout","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542156"},"it":{"name":"Nous sommes partout","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542156"},"sp":{"name":"Nous sommes partout","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542156"},"pt":{"name":"Nous sommes partout","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542156"},"cn":{"name":"Nous sommes partout","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.542156"}},"place":{"id":240987,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National Wallonie-Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain","address_street_number":"111","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatrenational.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 41 55","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain, 111","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Le r\u00e9cent et tr\u00e8s \u00e9pur\u00e9 b\u00e2timent du Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National dispose de trois salles, certainement parmi les plus belles de Belgique, aux qualit\u00e9s techniques irr\u00e9prochables. C\u2019est un th\u00e9\u00e2tre qui veut aller \u00e0 la rencontre des artistes et du public tout comme des autres arts et des cultures d\u2019ici et d\u2019ailleurs. C\u2019est un lieu o\u00f9 les id\u00e9es se partagent et s\u2019entrechoquent \u00e0 foison. Orchestr\u00e9e par Fabrice Murgia, la programmation allie th\u00e9\u00e2tre et danse, pointures internationales et cr\u00e9ations belges francophones tout en cr\u00e9ant des ponts avec son homologue (et presque voisin) flamand, le KVS.  ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National Wallonie-Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Emile Jacqmainlaan","address_street_number":"111","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatrenational.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 41 55","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussel","address_line1":"Emile Jacqmainlaan, 111","address_line2":"1000 Brussel","description_web":"Het Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National beschikt over drie zalen van uitzonderlijke technische geluidskwaliteit. De programmering is bestemd voor een ruim publiek, waarbij er ruimte is voor intelligente en veeleisende voorstellingen, maar ook voor plezierige en emotionele stukken. Het theater wil een ontmoetingsplaats zijn voor zowel beroemde als bijzondere artiesten uit het Belgische en het Europese theaterlandschap. Artistiek leider Fabrice Murgia zet de nauwe samenwerking met zijn Vlaamse tegenhanger en bijna buur de KVS voort. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National Wallonie-Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain","address_street_number":"111","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatrenational.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 41 55","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Brussels","address_line1":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain, 111","address_line2":"1000 Brussels","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National Wallonie-Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain","address_street_number":"111","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatrenational.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 41 55","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain, 111","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Das moderne und schn\u00f6rkellose Geb\u00e4ude des Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber drei S\u00e4le, die zu den sch\u00f6nsten Belgiens z\u00e4hlen. Das Theater sucht die Begegnung mit den K\u00fcnstlern, dem Publikum und anderen Kunstformen und Kulturen. Ein Ort des Ideenaustauschs und der Konfrontation, unter der Leitung von Fabrice Murgia, dessen Programm auf belgisches und internationales Theater und Tanz setzt. Das Theater ist vor allem franz\u00f6sischsprachig, aber auch internationale Produktionen kommen teils in Originalsprache auf die B\u00fchne - oftmals gibt es sogar mehrsprachige Untertitel. Auch der Ausstausch mit seinem fl\u00e4mischen Pendant KVS ist ein wichtiger Eckpfeiler der Philosophie.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National Wallonie-Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain","address_street_number":"111","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatrenational.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 41 55","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain, 111","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National Wallonie-Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain","address_street_number":"111","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatrenational.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 41 55","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain, 111","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre National Wallonie-Bruxelles","address_street_name":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain","address_street_number":"111","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@theatrenational.be","website":"http:\/\/www.theatrenational.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 203 53 03","phone_booking":"+32 2 203 41 55","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Boulevard Emile Jacqmain, 111","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_