ans une toute nouvelle salle \u00e0 l'acoustique superbe, le Boudoir de la Tricoterie. Achetez d\u00e8s aujourd'hui vos billets pour cet \u00e9v\u00e9nement incontournable !","performers":"Brussels Young Adult Choir (dir. Johannes Dewilde), Aziliz (dir. Judith Sepulchre)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543680"},"nl":{"name":"BYAC&AZILIZ Joint Concert","shortdescr":"Welkom op dit gezamenlijke concert van BYAC & AZILIZ!","longdescr":"Op 23 oktober om 17 uur komt BYAC bijeen voor een gezamenlijk concert met Ensemble Vocal Aziliz! Met het vrouwelijke Aziliz onder leiding van Judith Sepulchre en het gemengde jongvolwassenenkoor BYAC onder leiding van Johannes Dewilde wordt u verwend. Het optreden van deze 2 gloednieuwe Brusselse koren vindt plaats in een gloednieuwe zaal met een uitstekende akoestiek, het Boudoir in La Tricoterie Koop vandaag nog uw tickets voor dit niet te missen evenement!","performers":"Brussels Young Adult Choir (dir. Johannes Dewilde), Aziliz (dir. Judith Sepulchre)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.billetweb.fr\/aziliz-x-byac-joint-concert1?fbclid=IwAR0u6HCNX9LLZqyYySOoYrtPsHajCDJInT_RUeXsYywtmuJWScMM1Wca_kw","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543680"},"en":{"name":"BYAC&AZILIZ Joint Concert","shortdescr":"Welcome to this joint BYAC & AZILIZ concert!","longdescr":"On October 23rd at 5pm, BYAC will get together for a joint concert with Ensemble Vocal Aziliz! You\u2019re in for a treat with the all-female Aziliz conducted by Judith Sepulchre and mixed young adult choir BYAC conducted by Johannes Dewilde. The performance of these 2 brand new choirs from Brussels will take place in a brand new venue with superb acoustics, the Boudoir in La Tricoterie Buy your tickets today for this must-see event!","performers":"Brussels Young Adult Choir (dir. Johannes Dewilde), Aziliz (dir. Judith Sepulchre)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543680"},"de":{"name":"BYAC&AZILIZ Joint Concert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543680"},"it":{"name":"BYAC&AZILIZ Joint Concert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543680"},"sp":{"name":"BYAC&AZILIZ Joint Concert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543680"},"pt":{"name":"BYAC&AZILIZ Joint Concert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543680"},"cn":{"name":"BYAC&AZILIZ Joint Concert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":null,"email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.543680"}},"place":{"id":252101,"translations":{"fr":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"joelle@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie se d\u00e9finit comme un lieu pluridisciplinaire avec 4 axes d'activit\u00e9s: l'\u00e9v\u00e9nementiel, le culturel, la formation et les initiatives \u00abcitoyennes \u00bb. Les activit\u00e9s sont de deux types. D'une part, les productions propres, qui constituent la saison, avec la programmation d'artistes associ\u00e9s, un march\u00e9 bio, des soir\u00e9es th\u00e9matiques ou encore des animations de quartier. D'autre part, le lieu est un outil mis \u00e0 disposition d'organisations externes et d'entreprises. Une foule de f\u00eates tr\u00e8s int\u00e9ressantes y ont lieu ! ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Contactenfabriek","address_street_name":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"joelle@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Sint-Gillis","address_line1":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat, 158","address_line2":"1060 Sint-Gillis","description_web":"La Tricoterie is een project met een welomlijnde filosofie, die blijkt uit de zelfgekozen naam (van tricoter, breien) waarmee verwijst wordt naar het smeden van banden om de strijd tegen de ontrafeling van het sociale weefsel aan te gaan. Opgezet als een \u00abContacten Fabriek\u00bb en een ontmoetingsplaats waar verschillende disciplines en publieken elkaar ontmoeten. Naast een culturele programmering (concerten, voorstellingen, expos\u2026) en socioculturele activiteiten die sociale cohesie beogen (debatten, conferenties, intergenerationele ateliers, caf\u00e9-filo\u2026) staan de ruimtes ook open voor verhuur aan externe organisaties en bedrijven. Tal van superleuke feestjes vinden er plaats, alsook een wekelijkse biomarkt, een repaircaf\u00e9 en een alternatieve geschenkenmarkt om maar enkele van de activiteiten te noemen die de duurzame levensvisie van de plek weerspiegelen.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Link factory","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"joelle@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie is above all a civil, cultural, sustainable and innovative project. Their cultural programme featuring performances, shows, exhibitions and so on goes hand in hand with a \u201ccivil\u201d programme of debates, conferences, inter-generational workshops, philosophical caf\u00e9 etc ... The place can be rented for events and there are plenty of really great parties! ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"joelle@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"joelle@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"