, ce serait dommage, levez les yeux et appr\u00e9ciez le paysage...\r\nLangues: allemand - anglais - espagnol - fran\u00e7ais - n\u00e9erlandais - portugais","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"nl":{"name":"Pro Velo","address_street_name":"Londenstraat","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@provelo.org","website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Elsene","address_line1":"Londenstraat, 15","address_line2":"1050 Elsene","description_web":"De vzw Pro V\u00e9lo streeft naar meer mobiliteit voor de Brusselse fietsers en organiseert gegidste fietstochten in het Nederlands, Frans en Engels. Kortom, een fijn idee voor wie graag met de haren in de wind de stad afschuimt.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Pro Velo","address_street_name":"Rue de Londres","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@provelo.org","website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de Londres, 15","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"The Pro Velo non-profit association aims to improve mobility for cyclists in Brussels. It organises guided bicycle tours in Dutch, French, and English. A pleasant and active way of exploring the city with neither windscreen nor roof in your way, giving you a completely unimpeded view.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Pro Velo","address_street_name":"Rue de Londres","address_street_number":"15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@provelo.org","website":"http:\/\/www.provelo.org","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 73 55","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Rue de Londres, 15","address_line2":"1050 Ix