er Groupe des 20 wieder. Die Sammlungen werden in den reich mit Mobiliar und historischen Dekorationsgegenst\u00e4nden (Louis XV, Louis XV und Empire) best\u00fcckten Salons ausgestellt.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Charlier","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Charlier","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"El Museo Charlier, una mansi\u00f3n del siglo XIX obra de Horta durante sus a\u00f1os de juventud, te sumergir\u00e1 en la atm\u00f3sfera de un lujoso sal\u00f3n de arte: la Belle Epoque te invita a so\u00f1ar, a pasear entre las esculturas de Charlier, Hager y Wouters, las pinturas de Smits, Fr\u00e9d\u00e9ric, Oleffe, Laermans, Van Strydonck, Ensor... Este ambiente \u00edntimo se completa con los muebles de los ebanistas Chapuis, Sen\u00e9, Nadal l'A\u00een\u00e9, numerosos objetos de arte decorativo de estilos Luis XIV, XV, XVI y estilo Imperio, tapices de Bruselas y Audenaerde, as\u00ed como excepcionales un excepcional sal\u00f3n chino. ","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Charlier","address_s