het prive-herenhuis van de beeldhouwer Guillaume Charlier, dat dateert uit de 19e eeuw. Het richt zich op de Belgische schilderkunst van eind 19e tot begin 20e eeuw. De collecties worden getoond in de salons, rijkelijk voorzien van decoratieve stukken uit de Louis XV, Louis XVI en Empire periodes.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Charlier Museum","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"The museum is based in the private mansion, dating from the 19th century, of the sculptor Guillaume Charlier. It focuses on Belgian painting from the late 19th to the early 20th century. Its art exhibitions take place in a setting of lavish furnishings, with numerous decorative pieces from the Louis XV, Louis XVI, and Empire periods.","description_print":"","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9e Charlier","address_street_name":"Avenue des Arts","address_street_number":"16","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@charliermuseum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.charliermuseum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 81 61","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 81 61","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Avenue des Arts, 16","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Das 1928 eingeweihte Museum ist wie ein Gem\u00e4lde der Epoche... man findet sich in der Zeit der La Libre Est\u00e9tique und der Groupe des 20 wieder. Die Sammlungen werden in den reich mit Mobiliar und historischen Dekorationsgegenst\u00e4nden (Louis XV, Louis XV und Empire) best\u00fcckten Salons ausgestellt.","description_pr